'''Mooth''' (ガガガガ, ''Gagagaga'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

