==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Mooth
|Maawth
|[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] version of Mooth. He is stronger, has longer range (370) and 30% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] Cat Units for 2 seconds.
|Othom
|[[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] version of Mooth. Far stronger, with an Omni Strike hitting up to 440 range and a guaranteed chance to [[Curse|curse]] Cat Units for 2 seconds, but has relatively low damage for a Relic.
|Sister Lione
|An enemy first seen in [[Another New Year (Monthly Event)|Another New Year]]. Has more health and range, plus a guaranteed chance to [[Weaken|weaken]] Cat Units' attack power to 50%, with many knockbacks, but slower.
|Mega-Mooth
|A [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant only found in [[Mega Menace]]. Similar to Othom, but stands at 370 and hits up to 470, and 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats that survive his attacks. Starts out weak, but receives massive buffs in later stages.
}}

